contentText:
Olivia Rodrigo is a favorite of many rock stars, and in a new interview, Billy Corgan broke down why he — much like Sheryl Crow, Robert Smith, Jack White, Mick Jagger, Alanis Morissette, Stevie Nicks and more icons — is in her corner.

